# Milestone 1 (G12): every M1 region on the feature-rich fixture ("rich": branches, merges, tags, stashes, a
# remote, a merge in progress with staged, unstaged, untracked and conflicted files), dark theme, 1280x720, then
# the main window in the light theme. Compare with the layout specs 07, 08 and 09.
resize 1280x720
set theme dark
open repository rich
wait idle
shot m1-02-main-log
select uncommitted row
wait idle
shot m1-03-uncommitted-status
select file unstaged src/app.txt
wait idle
shot m1-04-diff-unified
set diff split
wait idle
shot m1-05-diff-split
set diff unified
clear file selection
select log row 2
wait idle
shot m1-06-commit-changes
expand side sections
wait idle
shot m1-07-side-panel-expanded
open context menu branch main at 120 170
wait idle
shot m1-08-branch-menu
close menu
open dialog settings
assert dialog open
wait idle
shot m1-09-settings
close dialog
open dialog new-branch
assert dialog open
wait idle
shot m1-10-create-branch
close dialog
open blame src/app.txt
wait idle
shot m1-11-blame
close view
open history src/app.txt
wait idle
shot m1-12-file-history
close view
wait idle
set theme light
wait idle
shot m1-14-main-light
set theme dark
assert no error
